<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Music Theory App</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #c3cfe2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            color: #333;
        }
        .header {
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .header p {
            color: #7f8c8d;
            font-size: 1.2em;
        }
        .nav-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .nav-card {
            border: none;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            background-color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 100%;
        }
        .nav-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .nav-card h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-size: 1.3em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .nav-card p {
            color: #7f8c8d;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .user-panel {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            text-align: right;
            background: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .user-panel a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #3498db;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .user-panel a:hover {
            color: #2980b9;
        }
        .user-panel span {
            margin-right: 15px;
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .nav-grid a[href="/support_me"] {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, #fffbf0 100%);
            border: 2px solid #f1c40f;
        }
        .nav-grid a[href="/about_me"] {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, #f0fdfa 100%);
            border: 2px solid #1abc9c;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="user-panel">
        <% if (user) { %>
            <span>Welcome, <%= user.user_name %>!</span>
            <a href="/chat" style="margin-right: 15px; color: #8e44ad;">🤖 AI Assistant</a>
            <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
        <% } else { %>
            <a href="/login">Login</a>
        <% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="header">
        <h1>Welcome to Music Theory App</h1>
        <p>Select a topic to practice</p>
    </div>

    <div class="nav-grid">
        <a href="/chromatic" class="nav-card">
            <h3>Chromatic Scale Identify</h3>
            <p>Practice identifying chromatic scales and their notations.</p>
        </a>
        
        <a href="/clef_minor" class="nav-card">
            <h3>Clef & Minor Keys</h3>
            <p>Identify the clef and minor key from the musical score.</p>
        </a>
        
        <a href="/compound_simple" class="nav-card">
            <h3>Compound & Simple Time</h3>
            <p>Practice metric modulation between simple and compound time.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/duration_equation" class="nav-card">
            <h3>Duration Equation</h3>
            <p>Calculate note durations and time signatures.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/grouping_quiz" class="nav-card">
            <h3>Grouping & Beaming Quiz</h3>
            <p>Identify correct grouping and beaming in musical notation.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/instrument_knowledge" class="nav-card">
            <h3>Instrument Knowledge Quiz</h3>
            <p>Test your knowledge on instruments, clefs, and terms.</p>
        </a>
        
        <a href="/interval" class="nav-card">
            <h3>Interval Quiz</h3>
            <p>Identify the interval between two notes.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/inversion" class="nav-card">
            <h3>Inversion Quiz</h3>
            <p>Identify the chord inversion (Root, 1st, 2nd).</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/melody_key" class="nav-card">
            <h3>Melody Key</h3>
            <p>Identify the key of a given melody.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/pitch_id" class="nav-card">
            <h3>Pitch Identification</h3>
            <p>Identify musical notes on different clefs with various accidentals.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/same_pitch" class="nav-card">
            <h3>Same Pitch</h3>
            <p>Identify two melodies that sound the same across different clefs.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/transposing" class="nav-card">
            <h3>Transposition Quiz</h3>
            <p>Practice transposing music between different keys and clefs.</p>
        </a>
    </div>

    <hr style="margin: 40px 0; border: 0; border-top: 2px solid #eee;">

    <div class="nav-grid">
        <a href="/support_me" class="nav-card">
            <h3>Support Me ☕️</h3>
            <p>Support the development of this app.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/about_me" class="nav-card">
            <h3>About Me 😄</h3>
            <p>Learn more about the developer.</p>
        </a>
    </div>

    <footer style="margin-top: 40px; color: #888; font-size: 0.9em;">
        &copy; Chan Chak Hang Max 2026 version 1.0.1
    </footer>

    <%- include('partials/ai_chat') %>
</body>
</html>
